Content provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Knowledge base (knowledge-base/): the entries are original summaries
written for this project. Each file cites its authoritative source; no
text is reproduced from those sources. Consult the cited primary sources
for authoritative and current guidance.

Detection content (detections/sigma/): all rules are original work
authored for this project, expressed in the Sigma rule format. They are
lab-scoped and defensive; see detections/README.md.

Compliance mappings (compliance/): control-to-framework mappings are this
project's own interpretation for engineering-posture tracking. They are
not a certification, an audit, or legal/compliance advice, and they are
not endorsed by any framework owner or standards body.

Sample logs (sample-logs/): synthetic fixtures created for testing. They
contain no real hosts, users, addresses, or captured production data.

